{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:016e6b1870696be9fbea3525e4006d357cb3c58f0d19af137167087f55810116",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8291adf1697502fac1eea6f477601d1f6fd449a4700cc3a4a7cce5894755f6e9",
      "text": "带着笑容Shall we dance",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2329f651bd4f1f2600d71d834d2729316654ee9a43ca83c37d0d9e8272332fd6",
      "text": "经制作人的推荐，皮埃尔决定参加\n电视剧的试镜。\n试镜的结果是他拿下的角色，\n竟然是导演他们从皮埃尔的演技中获得灵感而设计的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8291adf1697502fac1eea6f477601d1f6fd449a4700cc3a4a7cce5894755f6e9",
      "text": "带着笑容Shall we dance",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4769a183de9693bf90817df8a0f67e192919af51bac3d11a413a078522d9a838",
      "text": "（电视剧的试镜吗。\n如果是这个题材的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b6f03b41d9fb5e150cda158ffe3b851619832c644893840cffb2bd997404f72",
      "text": "啊，皮埃尔先生！\n现在方便打扰一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6047156ec9498e092af6bdadff105b6934a086a0fe4320d3c8d1ef70bf6f666",
      "text": "可以哦！\n●●●●プロデューサー，怎么啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d92f3a66fe1a9c0a61568418907633031ca97014347dc4ccba2ffcda709f518",
      "text": "听说皮埃尔先生有着相当于\n剑道五段的实力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d17d5d1c80be703f5f9ebfd2fd7cdca4be0b972a9a8c3b29b74fdf81155ce54d",
      "text": "有一部以击剑为题材的电视剧。\n想不想去参加试镜试试看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ac331ac3fd773860860aeb34321eef4a575ea3c16bff842039eb68ea4b8d4d",
      "text": "击剑！\n我也会击剑哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e6b6a4966fac5f6939e9cddb383b83c9dbc5bcbb3c4863ea6cebc9023a1260",
      "text": "咦，真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90b66f8818a61a9aa83a2609066cb06a6170bcdfa00f55048a092511d44c56a1",
      "text": "嗯！Êtes-vous prêts！Oui！Allez！\n击剑，在老家学过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:344c19c0e75bd9850897d0693eadd009120c538df5e97d11783721fdb9e28307",
      "text": "我，想成为更加更加了不起的偶像！\n所以，试镜，要去参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f870705300454825f4c333778a3c2399e2807210f28a476998747f4d207282c4",
      "text": "绝对要合格！加油、加油，哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eca5bbb1fa78d35aa198d3e81e0dba68b9083054421ede6d539e7ce9a5b7d45",
      "text": "试镜会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81e3d67e41885ef6735b9d53439f933bfd077e749d0273fecbc6a7efb86959ff",
      "text": "终于到试镜当天了呢……\n皮埃尔先生，状态如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a56aeb4365593cb0021fb31fa7127299f140c0ef9da223bc69b00143fe3338e",
      "text": "没问题！面试的练习，做了好多好多！\n恭二、实，都有帮我练习！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0c87ca8eb72f072b4ea9cbfe4dfc7ea8a170f6e48de57cb9f105ddf145bfd6c",
      "text": "“我叫皮埃尔！\n隶属于315 Production！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66adf833ecc6e1032a4475f76cc109822e0c5c3e329343573c98b02300b6434",
      "text": "“试镜，我会加油的！\n请多关——照！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7fe36acb77efe9098b629d69598b872c107e3c9987db8e6eae2792b5412459f",
      "text": "……怎么样，●●●●プロデューサー？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cbd3992a3a1ee5ad48f5812d6615e2b6928b14b4588429aba286d5d16c929ea",
      "text": "充满元气，非常有皮埃尔先生的风格，很棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee9825a28bc43f2e6189d0853185e8e59f5cdef1643a6c681d60d111d8e35ef1",
      "text": "别忘了保持笑容，好好加油去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8f0d7c340095fc4741c168f3a7ece5d8fcf4c2e21e8c85fd3ff362553c8870d",
      "text": "嗯！笑容，很重要，我知道！\n笑容是闪闪发光的幸福魔法！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b66d19be79d77002db4fd34023237454797adba7592dfb854c1dc1900717910b",
      "text": "……啊，叫到我名字了！\n我出发了，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40080583766ea198270ffa605fccd42e15b6bbdeb7d1f11b3ac57e1b92a5b2e0",
      "text": "好的，路上小心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:791b94281b02e8c34b4c385da97c2260c60339331b06f0a63db4296e06fecaa8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n试镜的结果，今天会来。真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e18d3317674ccb46d25fa11c96cf205ce99f8eaa9044f89b67049acf8b7edd0e",
      "text": "是的。不过那是合格了的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d196e09788b75156325589cf0605306ed0987c1eda5f7ca0462960ad617d6324",
      "text": "要是不合格，电话就不来吗？\n我好想电话快点打来……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2dfdf9894f3c2e0849deb0d70163789e05e5a03bcb039e43e2ad101f16305a1",
      "text": "……！喂，您好……是的。是的……\n真的吗，非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb80b3ca487aa49277bfbcb8f04b6fecd0224da4d6404080369d05ba1e29bddf",
      "text": "太好了，皮埃尔先生。合格了！\n而且，似乎是个特别的角色哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75a2c13fd425f20a3d0695b8b70f9f8a1e1f71882a1a6dd6c95d81771618cb20",
      "text": "特别，是什么？什么意思？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:751c1b58864c9c7384b1c4e842d2ef33e0d8ebf55d38340e078abe39758eeb6c",
      "text": "听说导演和编剧从皮埃尔先生的表演中\n获得了灵感，追加了一个全新的角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f44233db81f7a23057e0065c228ba2902f91d9ef4509900a8736f9870a8d31c",
      "text": "好像是一个被称为“击剑界王子”的\n男孩子的角色。真令人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5a6c35b92f3ae95210617441c77878c40bf6262dd0d0586148df591cc28be35",
      "text": "嗯，非常非常期待！\n我合格了，好开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:979e15475dfea910ed2dbf1011e7ccd7d376fc0b03c72cdb8090b1315c0c26f7",
      "text": "我会演好给大家看的。\n我会超级加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7928d7cc03ff8999486e0239e63b155711c58f5f1aaeea255a59120ede31a647",
      "text": "你看你看，●●●●プロデューサー！\n电视剧的剧本送到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e764c0ec8343d58cc3824884e213ba19e264ca248808a56bca07ba61a6a1b13",
      "text": "好的。那我们赶快先过目一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64c9c444e7d768ee92822dee5c1efaeb18415ba2360084977ee416afbc845284",
      "text": "嗯！……哇啊。\n有好多难懂的汉字，好难……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e1faf704b1819ca907e52161d68346e74316fbc4e9f7488ab20492c885757c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n想让你帮忙标读音……可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdbf5a798e3679431f9b045b04425c6e597b11b49fc575da57c0243820b27849",
      "text": "当然可以了。机会难得，\n我们就一边查一边写上去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c26f13e796ee6fcd832eba9ccd2e27b0fb2cb996c48320deff34e737bb04f7",
      "text": "这样一来也能顺便练习汉字。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31e9aaf06b18cf3c1c5c30816304667aa9dc3cf3ee08e389a3b07547ad1ed615",
      "text": "嗯，知道了！练汉字就像上学一样。\n我好期待♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e635c6f6ac208cb258a9b9b96a37415a20bac213680b5f81aff28122aca7c875",
      "text": "啊……我的角色，有跳华尔兹的镜头。\n剧本上写着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f0dec45e632beaa91438b49e8054ea7f05287501d95009c720d90c212ff4b3c",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n会跳华尔兹吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d8d4847bf13c7f9c3cbd82920b091ba555e2587ad6f2114fb746425ad3fa43",
      "text": "哎，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b14abbceb1567cd7a3160c8753c4c6c5e0a76b163026de44eece1842ae785236",
      "text": "我平时总是让●●●●プロデューサー\n教我各种各样的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c16f8599cc9ebb19fa97aa3d0282b15535e82941d7852d9237a8a6a4c169665",
      "text": "我会跳华尔兹。所以，\n我可以教●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cfe3fee5bcbc7f8e42885aa8261c5143767fede0d27b99d0d42e78ddbffa37",
      "text": "站起来，●●●●プロデューサー。\n跟我一起跳华尔兹吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93b8bf10cc5f6ffc17ef640a673fc8841f39852342a872270cb809bcf23bdf0b",
      "text": "好、好的。……在事务所里跳舞，\n总觉得有点害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac1e34e8c0f667271a6622df0c1d7ed654700323d6ff28af090a2ea5b5d66fa",
      "text": "呵呵！不用觉得害羞！\n觉得跳舞很开心的心情，才是最重要的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34a6092ebd26f2f1f90b83f4b15b257c677eb3ebaf6fce4f90995f416e22b957",
      "text": "配合我的节奏，跳起来好吗？\nUn, deux, trois。Un, deux, trois……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118c1f321921adaf53fea10d4680bd2df45c3f1126bac8c3bb67538103a999f4",
      "text": "是这样吗？\nUn, deux, trois……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6e6d57ca23b8b953462ca0f2711ee2d7e2c975a33d009c5f6c67e89f83c5eed",
      "text": "嗯，太棒了！\n●●●●プロデューサー，跳得真好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c988a8eb96cba81dc9becd77c1185093224cd6c55f1ee05193d120e558503944",
      "text": "（……太好了。●●●●プロデューサー脸上带着笑容\n在跳呢。跳舞也是带来笑容的魔法）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_010pie_01_1_2_010_01:1_2_010_01_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34f57abc2cea249b3baaa0a211d000ea3c766f7d40577f26e094835d78df53e1",
      "text": "（真希望有朝一日，我的祖国也能\n充满像你这样的笑容啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
